  "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Mack &amp; Rex Brand Introduction:</b> Welcome to Mack &amp; Rex! We&rsquo;re a small, family-owned business in Utah, started by a mom and her two young daughters. Our mission is to spread happiness through the joy of DIY beading, inspiring creativity and bringing people together with our high-quality bracelet kits, tutorials, beading supplies and a wide range of Jewelry products<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Product Description:</b> Our DIY bracelet kits are designed for all ages and skill levels, making it easy and fun to create beautiful bracelets. Each kit contains everything you need, including beads, cords, and detailed instructions. One kit can make over 80 bracelets, perfect for crafting sessions with family and friends.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Aside from our DIY bracelet kits we also a wide range of products ranging from bracelets, earrings, necklaces and much more.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Payment Terms:</b> As a Mack &amp; Rex brand ambassador, you will earn a 12% commission on all sales made through your unique link. Payments are made on Paypal facilitated through uppromote platform.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>Join Us:</b> Ready to join us in spreading happiness? Become a Mack &amp; Rex brand ambassador today and share the joy of DIY beading with your audience. Let&rsquo;s craft happiness together! <o:p></o:p></p>",
